{"id":"n65811-2-10","stage":1,"title":"시간표 · 时刻表","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65811-2-10-1","ko":"혹시 이 유람선이 몇 시에 출발하는지 알아?","zh":"你知道这艘游轮几点出发吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"유람선이","meaning":"游船，游览船","explanation":"유람선：游船，游览船；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유람선","audio":"/audio/eae7a3ec16ae17c397ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70434","senseId":"1","lemma":"유람선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유람선이","audio":"/audio/86e5d6f41ea9e8d1c4d1.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시에","audio":"/audio/d114a7f7c3eca4fa0970.mp3"}},{"text":"출발하는지","meaning":"出发","explanation":"출발하다：出发；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"출발하다","audio":"/audio/9d29571af3ae5f65bacf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72141","senseId":"1","lemma":"출발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출발하는지","audio":"/audio/c24b0faa230de053b9e8.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아","audio":"/audio/afb5239ccd10c522dc68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"eae7a3ec16ae17c3","term":"유람선","zh":"游船，游览船","audio":"/audio/eae7a3ec16ae17c397ae.mp3","entryId":"70434","definition":"运载游览者的船。","pronunciation":["유람선"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"9d29571af3ae5f65","term":"출발하다","zh":"出发","audio":"/audio/9d29571af3ae5f65bacf.mp3","entryId":"72141","definition":"离开原地向某处去。","pronunciation":["출발하다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e23f48e8d3ad461f20e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65811-2-10-2","ko":"잠깐만, 시간표 좀 보고 올게.","zh":"稍等一下，我先去看看时刻表再回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만,","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","o